#### 1. Commitment Ledger Module ✅
**File:** [mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/commitment_ledger.py](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/commitment_ledger.py)

**Features:**
- JSON schema with full context tracking
- Context analysis engine:
  - Novelty detection (high/medium/low)
  - Dopamine level (fun vs. boring tasks)
  - Urgency parsing
  - Emotional load (guilt scoring)
- Aging tier system:
  - 🟢 Green: <3 days
  - 🟡 Yellow: 3-7 days
  - 🔴 Red: >7 days
- Suggestion engine:
  - `do_now` - Quick wins
  - `schedule` - Needs focused time
  - [archive](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/__init__.py#1761-1767) - Defer with reason
  - `kill` - No longer relevant

