## Architecture

**PEFS is a personal agentgraph:**

```
👤 You (Chairman)
    ↕ Judgment, creativity, final decisions
    
🤖 AI CEO (Nucleus MCP)
    ↕ Pattern detection, auto-closure, routing
    
📊 Commitment Ledger
    ↕ Central tracking database
    
🔍 Nightly Scanner ←→ 📱 Telegram Bot
    Detection           Reminder delivery
    
💾 Pattern Library
    Learning from successful closures
```

**Coordination at machine timescales:**
- Nightly scanner runs every 8 AM (automated)
- Telegram sends briefing every 8 AM (automated)
- Rabbit hole killer runs every 2 weeks (automated)
- You only act when escalated or reminded

**This implements Prof. Venkatraman's principles:**
- ✅ Dynamic decision rights (context-aware routing)
- ✅ Coordination-focused metrics (mental load, closure rate)
- ✅ Network effects (scale: more commitments tracked, scope: cross-project, speed: machine timescales)
- ✅ Modular capabilities (ledger, scanner, bot, killer as independent modules)
- ✅ Learning loops (pattern library from successful closures)

